  "description": "Lina, Adams and Milo make yummy pancakes with Mama in the kitchen! 🥞🍯🥄\nIn this English story for kids, children learn 8 new words: pancake, flour, milk, bowl, spoon, mix, honey and yummy. Listen, repeat, and learn English with Lina, Adams and Milo the cat.\n\n📚 New words in this story:\n🥞 pancake — فطيرة / بغرير — la crêpe épaisse (pancake)\n🌾 flour — دقيق / طحين — la farine\n🥛 milk — حليب — le lait\n🥣 bowl — زلافة / وعاء — le bol\n🥄 spoon — ملعقة — la cuillère\n🔄 mix — نخلط — mélanger\n🍯 honey — عسل — le miel\n😋 yummy — لذيذ — miam, délicieux\n\n👨‍👩‍👧 For parents: cook something simple with your child and name each thing in English. Only grown-ups touch the hot pan! Pause after each new word and say it out loud. Perfect for ages 3 to 8 and for children learning English as a second language.\n\n🇲🇦 قصة باللغة الإنجليزية للأطفال لتعلم كلمات المطبخ والطبخ.\n🇫🇷 Une histoire en anglais pour enfants pour apprendre les mots de la cuisine.\n\n🌙 Subscribe to Moon Tales Kids for a new English story every day!\n\n#EnglishForKids #KidsStories #LearnEnglish #MoonTalesKids",
